## media_player__HassMediaNext {#hass-media-next}

跳到下一首曲目或下一项。

{{toolText:media_player__HassMediaNext}}

## media_player__HassMediaPrevious {#hass-media-previous}

回到上一首曲目或上一项。

{{toolText:media_player__HassMediaPrevious}}

## media_player__HassMediaSearchAndPlay {#hass-media-search-and-play}

搜索音乐或其他媒体，并播放第一个结果。

{{toolText:media_player__HassMediaSearchAndPlay}}

## media_player__HassMediaPlayerMute {#hass-media-player-mute}

将媒体播放器静音。

{{toolText:media_player__HassMediaPlayerMute}}

## media_player__HassMediaPlayerUnmute {#hass-media-player-unmute}

取消媒体播放器的静音。

{{toolText:media_player__HassMediaPlayerUnmute}}

## intent__HassCancelAllTimers {#hass-cancel-all-timers}

取消所有正在运行的 Assist 定时器，或某个区域中的定时器。

{{toolText:intent__HassCancelAllTimers}}

## vacuum__HassVacuumStart {#hass-vacuum-start}

启动机器人吸尘器。

{{toolText:vacuum__HassVacuumStart}}

## vacuum__HassVacuumReturnToBase {#hass-vacuum-return-to-base}

让机器人吸尘器返回底座。

{{toolText:vacuum__HassVacuumReturnToBase}}

## vacuum__HassVacuumCleanArea {#hass-vacuum-clean-area}

